hadiths[94]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1103","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se nikah kiya jab main saat saal ki thi, aur mujh se suhbat ki jab main nau saal ki thi. Main gudiyon se khelti thi, aur ladkiyan mere paas aati thin. Jab woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekhtin to un se chhup jatin, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhein mere paas bhej dete."
"1104","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se nikah kiya jab main saat saal ki thi, aur mujh se suhbat ki jab main nau saal ki thi. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, aur doosri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1105","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Habib bin Abi Sabit se: Abdul Hameed bin Abdullah bin Abi Amr aur Qasim bin Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Haris bin Hisham ne use khabar di ke un dono ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin Haris bin Hisham ko Umm Salamah se hadees bayan karte suna ke unhon ne use khabar di: Jab woh Madinah aayin, unhon ne unhein khabar di ke woh Abu Umayyah bin Mughirah ki beti hain, to unhon ne unhein jhutlaya aur bole: Ajnabiyon jaisa jhoota kaun! Yahan tak ke un mein se ek shakhs ne Hajj ka irada kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum apne ghar walon ko khat likhogi? To unhon ne un ke sath khat likha. Phir woh Madinah wapas aaye. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir unhon ne mujhe sach mana aur main un par izzat mein badh gayi. Unhon ne farmaya: Jab main halal ho gayi, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas aaye aur mujhe paigham diya. To main ne un se kaha: Mujh jaisi se kaun nikah karega. Rahi main, mujhe aulad nahin aur main ghairat wali bachon wali hun. Aap ne farmaya: Main tum se bada hun; rahi ghairat to Allah use door kar dega; rahe bachche to Allah aur us ke Rasool ki taraf. Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se nikah kiya. Phir Aap un ke paas aane lage aur farmate: Zunab kahan hai? Yahan tak ke Ammar bin Yasir aaye aur use jhatak liya, aur farmaya: Yeh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko rokti hai, aur woh use doodh pila rahi thin. Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaye aur farmaya: Zunab kahan hai? To Quraibah bint Abi Umayyah, jo un ke paas un ke han thin, ne farmaya: Use Ammar bin Yasir le gaye. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tumhare paas raat ko aaoonga. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main uthi aur apni chakki ka chamda rakha, aur ek martaban mein se jau ke dane nikale, aur charbi nikali aur use pakaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne raat guzari aur subah ki. Phir subah hote hi farmaya: Tumhein apne ghar walon par izzat hai. Agar tum chaho main tumhare liye saat muqarrar karun, aur agar saat muqarrar karun to apni biwiyon ke liye saat muqarrar karunga."
"1106","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm se, Abdul Malik bin Abi Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab Umm Salamah se nikah kiya aur un ke paas subah ki to un se farmaya: Tum par tumhare ghar walon ki taraf se zillat nahin. Agar tum chaho main tumhare paas saat thehrun, aur un ke paas saat, aur agar tum chaho main tumhare paas teen thehrun phir daura karun. Unhon ne farmaya: Teen thehren."
"1107","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Humaid se, Anas se ke unhon ne farmaya: Kunwari ke liye saat, aur thayyibah ke liye teen."
"1108","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Rawwad ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein paigham diya, phir un ke nikah aur un se suhbat aur un se farmane ka zikr kiya: Agar tum chaho main tumhare paas saat thehrun aur un ke paas saat. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Khul' wan Nushooz se, aur chauthi Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1109","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nau biwiyon ko chhod kar fout hue, aur aath mein bari muqarrar karte the."
"1110","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nau biwiyon ko chhod kar fout hue, aur un ke darmiyan aath mein bari muqarrar karte the."
"1111","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, apne walid se: Saudah ne apna din Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko tohfe mein diya. Pehli Kitab Khul' wan Nushooz se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1112","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mere chacha Muhammad bin Ali bin Shafi' ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Aishah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ke unhon ne farmaya: Jab woh safar ka irada karte to apni biwiyon mein qura dalte. Jis ka qura nikalta use sath le jate. Kitab Khul' wan Nushooz se nikali."
"1113","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Hadh se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se poocha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka meher kitna tha? Unhon ne farmaya: Aap ka meher apni biwiyon ke liye barah ooqiyah aur nash tha. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho nash kya hai? Main ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Aadha ooqiyah. Kitab Sadaq wal Ila se nikali, aur woh us mein aakhri hadees hai."
"1114","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Humaid Taweel se, Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Madinah tashreef laye, Aap ne logon mein makanon ka qura dala. To Abdur Rahman bin Auf ka qura Sa'd bin Rabi' par nikla. To Sa'd ne un se kaha: Aao yahan tak ke main tum se apna maal taqseem karun, aur apni dono biwiyon mein se jo chaho tumhare liye chhod dun? Aur tumhein kaam se kifayat karun. To Abdur Rahman ne un se farmaya: Allah tumhein tumhare ghar walon aur maal mein barkat de; mujhe bazar dikhao. Phir woh us ki taraf nikle aur kuch paya. Phir unhon ne ek aurat ko paigham diya aur us se nikah kiya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aye Abdur Rahman, tum ne us se kitne meher par nikah kiya? Unhon ne farmaya: Sone ki guthli ke wazan par. Aap ne farmaya: Waleema karo chahe ek bakri se."
"1115","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Humaid Taweel se, Anas bin Malik se: Abdur Rahman bin Auf Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye aur un par zardi ka nishan tha. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se poocha. To unhon ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Ansar mein se ek aurat se nikah kiya hai. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne use kitna meher diya? Unhon ne farmaya: Sone ki guthli ke wazan barabar. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Waleema karo chahe ek bakri se."
"1116","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Humaid se, Anas se: Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne guthli ke wazan par nikah kiya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Sadaq wal Ila se, aur teesri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1117","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Hazim se, Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi se: Ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur boli: Aye Allah ke Rasool, main ne apni jaan Aap ko tohfe mein di hai. Phir woh der tak khadi rahi. Phir ek aadmi khada hua, aur bola aye Allah ke Rasool: Mujh se us ka nikah kar den agar Aap ko us ki hajat na ho. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tumhare paas koi cheez hai jo tum use meher do? To us ne kaha: Mere paas is tehband ke siva kuch nahin. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum use woh de doge, tum baghair tehband ke baithoge. Koi cheez talash karo. To us ne kaha: Mujhe koi cheez nahin milti. Aap ne farmaya: Talash karo chahe lohe ki angoothi. Phir us ne talash kiya aur use koi cheez na mili. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tumhare paas Quran mein se kuch hai? Us ne kaha: Han, fulan surat aur fulan surat, un suraton ke liye jin ka us ne naam liya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne us ka tum se nikah kar diya jo tumhare paas Quran mein se hai."
"1118","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Hazim se, Sahl (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aurat ka nikah Quran ki ek surat par kiya."
"1119","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Hazim bin Dinar se, unhon ne Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi ko kehte suna: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khadi aurat ka paigham diya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se us ke meher ke bare mein farmaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Talash karo chahe lohe ki angoothi. Pehli Kitab Sadaq wal Ila se, doosri Kitab Manasik se, aur teesri Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1120","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim bin Khalid aur Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ikrimah bin Khalid se: Ibn Ummul Hakam ne apni biwi se manga ke woh use apne marz mein us se us ki virasat se nikale, to us ne inkar kiya. To us ne kaha: Main tum par us mein use zaroor dakhil karunga jo tumhara haq kam kare ya use nuqsan pahunchaye. Phir us ne apne marz mein teen se nikah kiya; un mein se har ek ko ek hazaar deenar meher diya. To Abdul Malik bin Marwan ne ise jaiz qarar diya. Sa'id bin Salim ne farmaya: Agar un ka mahr misl ho to jaiz hai, aur agar zyada ho to ziyadti wapas ki jayegi. Aur muhabah mein unhon ne waisa farmaya jaisa main ne Kitab Wasaya mein kaha jise unhon ne us se nahin suna."
"1121","[AI-translation] Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Amr bin Dinar se: Unhon ne Ikrimah bin Khalid ko kehte suna: Abdur Rahman Ibn Ummul Hakam ne apni beemari mein chaha ke ek aurat ko us ki virasat se nikale, to us ne inkar kiya. To us ne us par teen aurton se nikah kiya aur unhein ek hazaar deenar meher diya har aurat ko un mein se. To Abdul Malik bin Marwan ne ise jaiz qarar diya aur unhein aathwin hisse mein shareek kiya. Rabi' ne farmaya: Yeh Shafi'i ka qaul nass hai. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Main ise un ka mahr misl samajhta hun, aur agar woh un ke mahr misl se zyada ho to nikah jaiz hai, aur jo un ke mahr misl se zyada hai batil hoga agar woh is marz mein fout ho jaye; kyunke woh wasiyat ke hukm mein hai, aur wasiyat waris ke liye jaiz nahin."
"1122","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Musa bin Uqbah se, Nafi' maula Ibn Umar se: Unhon ne farmaya: Hafs bin Mughirah ki beti Abdullah bin Abi Rabi'ah ke nikah mein thi. Us ne use ek talaq di. Phir Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us se nikah kiya. To khabar di gayi ke woh baanjh hai, janam nahin deti, to unhon ne use suhbat se pehle talaq de di. Phir woh Umar ki zindagi bhar aur Usman ki khilafat ke baaz rahi. Phir Abdullah bin Abi Rabi'ah ne us se nikah kiya jab woh beemar the take woh virasat mein un ki biwiyon ke sath shareek ho; aur un dono ke darmiyan rishtadari thi."
"1123","[AI-translation] Rabi' ne hamein Kitab Nikah mein Imla mein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Shafi'i ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Muslim bin Khalid ne khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Nafi' se: Ibn Abi Rabi'ah ne nikah kiya jab woh beemar the, phir yeh jaiz hua. Yeh chaaron hadeesein Kitab Nikah se nikali."
"1124","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se: Ibn Umar ne na nikah karne ka irada kiya. To Hafsah ne un se farmaya: Nikah karo; agar tumhare han ladka paida ho aur woh tumhare baad zinda rahe, woh tumhare liye dua karenge. Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1125","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje."
"1126","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah. Aur baaz muhaddiseen ne izafa kiya hai: Yahan tak ke woh ijazat de ya chhod de."
"1127","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje."
"1128","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ibn Musayyab ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje."
"1129","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ismail ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Muslim Khayyat se, Ibn Umar se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke aadmi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham bheje yahan tak ke woh us se nikah kare ya chhod de. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, teesri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur chauthi aur paanchwin Kitab Ta'reez bil Khitbah se nikali."
"1130","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se ke woh Allah Ta'ala ke farman ke bare mein farmaya karte the: Aur tum par koi gunah nahin jo tum aurton ko paigham mein ishara karo (Al-Baqarah: 235). Ke aadmi aurat se kahe jab woh apne shohar ki wafat ki iddat mein ho: Tum mujh par mu'azzaz ho, main tum mein raghbat rakhta hun, Allah Ta'ala tumhein khair ya rizq pahunchayega, ya is jaise qaul mein se."
"1131","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Yazid maula Aswad bin Sufyan se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Fatimah bint Qais se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Jab tum halal ho jao to mujhe khabar dena. Unhon ne farmaya: Jab main halal ho gayi, main ne unhein khabar di ke Muawiyah aur Abu Jahm ne mujhe paigham diya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Raha Muawiyah, woh miskeen hai, us ke paas maal nahin. Aur raha Abu Jahm, woh apni lathi kandhe se nahin utarta. Usamah bin Zaid se nikah kar lo. To main ne us se nikah kiya. To Allah ne us mein khair banayi, aur main us se khush hui."
"1132","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Yazid maula Aswad bin Sufyan se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Fatimah se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se un ke shohar ki talaq ki iddat mein farmaya: Jab tum halal ho jao to mujhe khabar dena. Unhon ne farmaya: Jab main halal ho gayi, main ne unhein khabar di ke Muawiyah aur Abu Jahm ne mujhe paigham diya hai. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raha Muawiyah, woh miskeen hai, us ke paas maal nahin. Aur raha Abu Jahm, woh apni lathi kandhe se nahin utarta. Usamah se nikah kar lo. Unhon ne farmaya: To main ne use napasand kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Usamah se nikah kar lo. To main ne us se nikah kiya. To Allah ne us mein khair banayi aur main us se khush hui. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur teesri Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1133","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Khusaim se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Nikah nahin magar seedhe wali aur do adil gawahon ke sath."
"1134","[AI-translation] Muslim aur Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abdullah bin Usman bin Khusaim se, Sa'id bin Jubair aur Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Nikah nahin magar wali, do adil gawahon, aur seedhe wali ke sath. Aur mera khayal hai Muslim ne use Ibn Khusaim se suna hai. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur doosri Kitab Ishratin Nisa se nikali."
"1135","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ismail Ibn Ulaiyah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Arubah se, Qatadah se, Hasan se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab do wali nikah karen to pehla zyada haqdar hai; aur jab do mukhtar bechen to pehla zyada haqdar hai."
"1136","[AI-translation] Ismail bin Ibrahim jo Ibn Ulaiyah ke naam se maroof hain, ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Arubah se, Qatadah se, Hasan se, ek aadmi se, Uqbah bin Aamir se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab do wali nikah karen to pehla zyada haqdar hai. Pehli Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur doosri Kitab Ishratin Nisa se nikali."
"1137","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Siqah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas un ke gharane ki aurat ka paigham aata aur woh hazir hotin. Phir jab nikah ka aqad baqi rehta to woh apne ghar walon mein se kisi se farmatin: Nikah kar do; kyunke aurat nikah ka aqad nahin karti."
"1138","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, Ibn Sireen se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Aurat aurat ka nikah na kare; kyunke badkar apni jaan ka nikah khud karti hai. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ishratin Nisa se nikali."
"1139","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim aur Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Sulaiman bin Musa se, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo aurat apne wali ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare, us ka nikah batil hai, teen baar."
"1140","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Sulaiman bin Musa se, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo aurat apne wali ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare, us ka nikah batil hai, teen baar. Aur agar woh us se suhbat kare to us ke liye meher hai jo us ne us ki sharmgah se halal kiya. Aur agar woh jhagden to hakim us ka wali hai jis ka koi wali nahin."
"1141","[AI-translation] Muslim aur Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne farmaya: Amr bin Dinar ne farmaya: Bani Bakr bin Kinanah mein se ek aurat, jise Bint Abi Sumamah kaha jata hai, ne Umar bin Abdullah bin Muzarris se nikah kiya. To Alqamah bin Alqamah Utwwari ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko likha, jab woh Madinah ke wali the: Main us ka wali hun, aur us ne mere hukm ke baghair nikah kiya hai, to Umar ne use radd kar diya halanke woh us se suhbat kar chuka tha. Unhon ne farmaya: Jo aurat apne wali ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare, us ka koi nikah nahin, kyunke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ka nikah batil hai. Aur agar woh us se suhbat kare to us ke liye us jaisa meher hai jo us ne us se hasil kiya, jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke liye us ka faisla farmaya."
"1142","[AI-translation] Muslim aur Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ikrimah bin Khalid ne khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Raste ne ek qafile ko jama kiya jin mein ek thayyibah aurat thi. To us ne un mein se ek aadmi ko apna mamla supurd kiya, aur us ne us ka ek aadmi se nikah kar diya. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne nikah karne wale aur nikah karane wale ko kode lagaye, aur us ka nikah radd kar diya."
"1143","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Abdur Rahman bin Ma'bad se: Umar ne us aurat ka nikah radd kar diya jis ne baghair wali ke nikah kiya tha."
"1144","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zubair se, unhon ne farmaya: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ek nikah laya gaya jis par sirf ek mard aur ek aurat ne gawahi di thi. To unhon ne farmaya: Yeh chhupa nikah hai; main ise jaiz nahin karta. Agar main is mein pehle faisla kar chuka hota to main rajm karta. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, doosri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur chhathi ke aakhir tak Kitab Ishratin Nisa se nikali."
"1145","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Rijal se, apni walida Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jod lagane wale mard aur jod lagwane wali aurat par lanat farmayi."
"1146","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, Fatimah se, Asma se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur boli: Aye Allah ke Rasool, meri beti ko khasra nikla aur us ke baal toot gaye; kya main us mein jod lagaun? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jod lagane wali aur lagwane wali par lanat ki gayi hai. Pehli Kitab Janaiz se, aur doosri Kitab Wuzu se nikali."
"1147","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Fazl se, Nafi' bin Jubair se, Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bewah apni jaan ki apne wali se zyada haqdar hai; aur kunwari se us ke bare mein ijazat mangi jayegi; aur us ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai."
"1148","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Fazl se, Nafi' bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bewah apni jaan ki apne wali se zyada haqdar hai; aur kunwari se us ke bare mein ijazat mangi jayegi; aur us ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, aur doosri Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i se nikali."
"1149","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Nu'aim ko hukm diya ke woh us ke bare mein us ki beti ki maan se mashwara kare."
"1150","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se, Abdur Rahman aur Mujammi' dono beton Yazeed bin Jariyah se, Khansa bint Khizam se: Un ke walid ne un ka nikah kiya, jab woh thayyibah thin. To unhon ne ise napasand kiya. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayin, to Aap ne un ka nikah radd kar diya. Pehli Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur doosri Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1151","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Ibn Musayyab se, Allah Ta'ala ke farman ke bare mein: Zanakar mard zanakar aurat ke siva se nikah nahin karta (An-Noor: 3), ayat. Unhon ne farmaya: Yeh mansookh hai; use nasakh kiya: Aur apne ghair shadishuda ka nikah kar do (An-Noor: 32). To woh Musalmanon ke ghair shadishuda mein se hai."
"1152","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yahya se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se ke unhon ne farmaya: Yeh mansookh hai; use nasakh kiya: Aur apne ghair shadishuda aur apne ghulamon aur laundiyon mein se nekon ka nikah kar do (An-Noor: 32). To woh Musalmanon ke ghair shadishuda mein se hai, yani Allah ka farman: Zanakar mard zanakar aurat ke siva se nikah nahin karta (An-Noor: 3), ayat."
"1153","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Yazeed se, ahl ilm mein se baaz se ke unhon ne is ayat ke bare mein farmaya: To woh un dono ke darmiyan faisla hai."
"1154","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Mujahid se: Yeh ayat jahiliyat ki badkaron mein se badkaron ke bare mein nazil hui jin ke gharon par jhande the. Pehli Kitab Ishratin Nisa se, aur chauthi ke aakhir tak Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1155","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ismail bin Abi Khalid se, Qais bin Abi Hazim se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Mas'ud ko kehte suna: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the aur hamare sath aurten nahin thin. To hum ne khassi hone ka irada kiya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein is se mana farmaya. Phir hamein rukhsat di ke hum aurat se muddat tak kisi cheez ke badle nikah karen."
"1156","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne apni kitab mein farmaya, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ismail bin Abi Khalid se, Qais bin Abi Hazim se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath jihad karte the aur hamare sath aurten nahin thin. To hum ne khassi hone ka irada kiya. To Aap ne hamein is se mana farmaya. Phir hamein rukhsat di ke hum aurat se muddat tak kisi cheez ke badle nikah karen. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees se, aur doosri Kitab Ikhtilaf Ali wa Abdillah mein se, us mein se jo Rabi' ne Shafi'i se nahin suna."
"1157","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Hasan aur Abdullah dono beton Muhammad bin Ali se, aur Hasan un dono mein zyada pasandeeda the, un dono ke walid se: Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nikah mut'ah aur paltu gadhe ke gosht se mana farmaya hai."
"1158","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se: Khaulah bint Hakeem Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aayin aur bolin: Rabi'ah bin Umayyah ne ek muwalladah aurat se mut'ah kiya aur woh us se hamila ho gayi. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) apni chadar ghaseette hue ghabra kar nikle. To unhon ne farmaya: Yeh mut'ah hai. Agar main is mein pehle faisla kar chuka hota to main use rajm karta."
"1159","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Abdullah aur Hasan dono beton Muhammad bin Ali se, un dono ke walid se, Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke din aurton ke mut'ah se aur paltu gadhe ke gosht khane se mana farmaya."
"1160","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Rabi' bin Sabrah se, apne walid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nikah mut'ah se mana farmaya."
"1161","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne apni kitab mein farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Abdullah aur Hasan dono beton Ali se, un dono ke walid se, Ali bin Abi Talib se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke saal nikah mut'ah se, aur paltu gadhe ke gosht se mana farmaya."
"1162","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne apni kitab mein farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Zuhri ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Rabi' bin Sabrah ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nikah mut'ah se mana farmaya. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees se, doosri Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, teesri aur chauthi Bab Shighar se, paanchwin Kitab Ta'am wash Sharab se, aur chhathi Kitab Ikhtilaf Ali wa Abdillah mein se, us mein se jo dono Rabi' ne Shafi'i se nahin sune."
"1163","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya. Aur shighar: Aadmi apni beti ka nikah is shart par kare ke doosra use apni beti ka nikah karaye, aur un dono ke darmiyan meher na ho."
"1164","[AI-translation] Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Abu Zubair ne khabar di: Unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya."
"1165","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Najeeh se, Mujahid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein shighar nahin."
"1166","[AI-translation] Rabi' ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Shafi'i, Muhammad bin Idris bin Abbas bin Usman bin Shafi' bin Sa'ib bin Ubaid bin Abd Yazeed bin Hashim bin Abdul Muttalib bin Abd Manaf bin Qusai bin Kilab bin Murrah bin Ka'b bin Luayy bin Ghalib bin Fihr bin Malik bin Nazr bin Kinanah bin Khuzaimah bin Mudrikah bin Ilyas bin Muzar bin Nizar bin Ma'add bin Adnan, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke chachazad, ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Malik bin Anas ne khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, aur Muslim bin Khalid ne, Ibn Juraij se, Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, dono ne, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ke Aap ne shighar se mana farmaya. Aur Malik ne apni hadees mein izafa kiya: Aur shighar: Aadmi aadmi ka apni beti se nikah kare is shart par ke woh use apni beti ka nikah karaye. Yeh teen hadeesein Bab Shighar se, aur chauthi Kitab Nikah mein Imla se, aur woh us mein pehli hadees hai."
"1167","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Qabeesah bin Zuaib se: Ek aadmi ne Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se milkiyat ki do behnon ke bare mein poocha: Kya un dono ko jama kiya jayega? To Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Un dono ko ek ayat ne halal kiya aur ek ayat ne haram kiya. Aur raha main, main yeh karna pasand nahin karta. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir woh un ke paas se nikla aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi se mila. To us ne farmaya: Agar mujhe mamle mein se kuch hota, phir main kisi ko aisa karte pata to use ibrat banata. Malik ne farmaya: Ibn Shihab ne farmaya: Main use Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) samajhta hun. Malik ne farmaya: Aur mujhe Zubair bin Awwam se usi jaisa pahunchi."
"1168","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, apne walid se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se aurat aur us ki beti ke bare mein jo milkiyat mein thin poocha gaya: Kya un mein se ek se doosri ke baad suhbat ki jayegi? To Umar ne farmaya: Main un dono ko jama jaiz karna pasand nahin karta."
"1169","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se maan aur us ki beti ke bare mein jo milkiyat mein thin poocha gaya. To unhon ne farmaya: Main pasand nahin karta ke hum un dono ko jama jaiz karen. Ubaidullah ne farmaya: Mere walid ne farmaya: Main chahta ke Umar is mein us se zyada sakht hote jaisa woh hain."
"1170","[AI-translation] Muslim aur Abdul Majeed ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Abi Mulaikah ko khabar dete suna: Mu'az bin Abdullah bin Ubaidullah bin Ma'mar Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aaye, aur un se kaha: Meri ek surriyah hai jis se main suhbat karta hun, aur us ki ek beti meri laundi ho gayi hai, to kya main us ki beti ko surriyah banaun? To unhon ne farmaya: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Main use nahin chhodunga magar yeh ke tum kaho: Allah Ta'ala ne use haram farmaya hai. To unhon ne farmaya: Mere ghar walon mein se koi aisa nahin karega, aur na koi jo meri ita'at kare."
"1171","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi aurat aur us ki phuphi ko jama na kare, aur na aurat aur us ki khala ko. Yeh chaar hadeesein Kitab Ishratin Nisa se, aur paanchwin Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1172","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Anas bin Iyaz ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Zainab bint Abi Salamah se, Umm Habibah bint Abi Sufyan se, unhon ne farmaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya Aap ko meri behan bint Abi Sufyan mein raghbat hai? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya karun? Unhon ne farmaya: Aap us se nikah karen. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari behan?! Unhon ne farmaya: Han. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ise pasand karti ho? Unhon ne farmaya: Han, main Aap ke sath akeli nahin; aur jo mere sath khair mein shareek ho use main sab se zyada pasand karti hun woh meri behan hai. Aap ne farmaya: Woh mere liye halal nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, mujhe khabar di gayi hai ke Aap Abu Salamah ki beti ko paigham de rahe hain. Aap ne farmaya: Abu Salamah ki beti? Unhon ne farmaya: Han. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, agar woh meri god mein parwarish pate hue beti na hoti, woh mere liye halal na hoti. Woh mere razai bhai ki beti hai; mujhe aur us ke walid ko Suwaibah ne doodh pilaya hai. Pas tum mujh par apni betiyan aur apni behnen pesh na karo."
"1173","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Dinar se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Urwah bin Zubair se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Razat woh haram karti hai jo wiladat haram karti hai."
"1174","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Jud'an ko kehte suna, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Musayyab ko Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se hadees bayan karte suna ke unhon ne farmaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya Aap ko apne chacha ki beti bint Hamzah mein raghbat hai? Woh Quraish ki khubsurat ladki hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum nahin jante ke Hamzah mere razai bhai hain, aur Allah ne razat se woh haram farmaya hai jo nasab se haram farmaya hai."
"1175","[AI-translation] Darawardi ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bint Hamzah ke bare mein Sufyan ki hadees ki tarah."
"1176","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Amr bin Shuraid se: Ibn Abbas se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha gaya jis ki do biwiyan thin; un mein se ek ne ek ladke ko doodh pilaya, aur doosri ne ek ladki ko doodh pilaya. To un se kaha gaya: Kya woh ladka us ladki se nikah kar sakta hai? To unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, liqah ek hai."
"1177","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein khabar di: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas the, aur unhon ne ek aadmi ki awaz suni jo Hafsah se ijazat mang raha tha. Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Phir main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, yeh aadmi Aap ke ghar mein ijazat mang raha hai. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main use fulan samajhta hun, Hafsah ke razai chacha ke liye. To main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, agar fulan zinda hote, un ke razai chacha ke liye, aur mere paas dakhil hote. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han, razat woh haram karti hai jo wiladat haram karti hai."
"1178","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, unhon ne farmaya: Mere chacha Aflah aaye, aur unhon ne hadees zikr ki. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur chhathi ke aakhir tak Kitab Raza' se, aur woh us mein sab se pehli hain, aur saatwin aur Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke qaul mere chacha Aflah aaye Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein."
"1179","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Amrah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se ke woh farmaya karti thin: Quran mein das maloom razaten nazil huin jo haram karti thin; phir woh paanch ho gayin jo haram karti hain. Aur Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas wohi dakhil hota tha jis ne paanch razaten poori ki hon."
"1180","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm se, Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se, Aishah Ummul Momineen (Raziyallahu anha) se ke unhon ne farmaya: Us mein jo Allah ne Quran mein nazil farmaya das razaten thin jo haram karti thin; phir woh paanch maloom razaton se mansookh huin. Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fout hue jabke woh Quran mein se padhi jati thin."
"1181","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Safiyyah bint Abi Ubaid se: Unhon ne use khabar di: Hafsah Ummul Momineen ne Aasim bin Abdullah bin Sa'd ko apni behan Fatimah bint Umar ki taraf bheja ke woh use das razaten pilaye take woh un ke paas dakhil ho jabke woh chhota doodh peeta tha. To unhon ne aisa kiya. To woh un ke paas dakhil hote the. Pehli Kitab Raza' se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1182","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Zubair se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek choosni aur na do choosniyan haram nahin karti, aur na ek razat aur na do razaten."
"1183","[AI-translation] Anas bin Iyaz ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Zubair se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek choosni aur na do choosniyan haram nahin karti."
"1184","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se: Salim bin Abdullah ne unhein khabar di: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Aishah ne use jab woh doodh peeta tha apni behan Umm Kulsoom ki taraf bheja. To unhon ne use teen razaten pilayin, phir beemar ho gayin aur use teen razaton ke siva na pilaya. To main Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas dakhil nahin hota tha kyunke Umm Kulsoom ne mere liye das razaten poori nahin ki thin. Pehli Kitab Raza' se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1185","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hajjaj bin Hajjaj se, mera khayal hai Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne farmaya: Razat se wohi haram karti hai jo aanten phaad de. Kitab Raza' se nikali."
"1186","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Aziz ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Ubaid bin Abdullah bin Zam'ah se: Un ki walida Zainab bint Abi Salamah ko Asma bint Abi Bakr zauja Zubair bin Awwam ne doodh pilaya tha. To Zainab bint Abi Salamah ne farmaya: Zubair mere paas dakhil hue jab main kanghi kar rahi thi. To unhon ne mere sir ki mendhiyon mein se ek mendhi pakdi aur farmaya: Meri taraf mutawajjeh ho aur mujh se baat karo. Main unhein samajhti ke woh mere walid hain; aur jo paida hue, woh mere bhai hain. Phir Harrah se pehle Abdullah bin Zubair ne meri taraf bheja aur meri beti Umm Kulsoom ka Hamzah bin Zubair ke liye paigham diya; Hamzah Kalbiyah se the. To main ne un ke qasid se kaha: Kya woh us ke liye halal hai? Woh sirf us ki bhatiji hai. To Abdullah bin Zubair ne meri taraf bheja: Main ne is rok se irada kiya kyunke tumhare paas woh mera bhai nahin. Main aur jo Asma ne jana, woh tumhare bhai hain; aur jo Zubair ki aulad Asma ke siva se hai, woh tumhare bhai nahin. Pas bhejo aur is ke bare mein poocho. To main ne bheja aur poocha; Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba bahut the aur Ummahatul Momineen. To unhon ne un se kaha: Mard ki taraf se razat koi cheez haram nahin karti. To unhon ne us ka us se nikah kar diya. Woh us ke paas rahin yahan tak ke woh fout ho gaye."
"1187","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr bin Alqamah se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se, Sa'id bin Musayyab aur Abu Salamah se, aur Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Ata bin Yasar se: Mard ki taraf se razat koi cheez haram nahin karti. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1188","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah bin Zubair se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sahlah bint Suhail ko hukm diya ke woh Salim ko paanch razaten pilaye aur woh un se haram ho jayega."
"1189","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Huzaifah ki biwi ko hukm diya ke woh Salim ko paanch razaten pilaye; woh us ke doodh se haram ho jayega. To unhon ne aisa kiya. Woh use beta samajhti thin."
"1190","[AI-translation] Mujhe Malik ne khabar di, Ibn Shihab se: Un se bade ke doodh ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Urwah bin Zubair ne khabar di: Abu Huzaifah bin Utbah bin Rabi'ah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se the aur Badr mein shareek hue the, unhon ne Salim ko beta banaya tha jise Salim maula Abi Huzaifah kaha jata hai, jaisa Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zaid bin Harisah ko beta banaya tha. To Abu Huzaifah ne Salim ka nikah kiya jab woh use apna beta samajhte the. To unhon ne us ka apne bhai ki beti Fatimah bint Waleed bin Utbah se nikah kiya, woh us waqt pehle Muhajireen mein se the, aur woh us waqt Quraish ki kunwariyon mein se afzal tareen thin. Jab Allah Ta'ala ne Zaid bin Harisah ke bare mein woh nazil farmaya jo nazil farmaya. To farmaya: Unhein un ke baapon ke naam se pukaro; yeh Allah ke nazdeek zyada insaf hai. Agar tum un ke baapon ko na jano to woh deen mein tumhare bhai hain (Al-Ahzab: 5). To un mein se har ek ne jise us ne beta banaya tha us ke baap ki taraf lautaya; agar us ke baap ko na janta to maulon ki taraf lautaya. To Sahlah bint Suhail, Abu Huzaifah ki biwi, jo Bani Aamir bin Luayy mein se thin, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayin aur bolin: Aye Allah ke Rasool, hum Salim ko beta samajhte the. Woh mere paas dakhil hote jab main ghar ke kapdon mein hoti, aur hamara ek hi ghar tha. To Aap us ke mamle mein kya farmate hain? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke bare mein jo hamein pahunchi farmaya: Use paanch razaten pilao, to woh us ke doodh se haram ho jayega. To main ne aisa kiya. Woh use razai beta samajhti thin. To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne use us ke bare mein liya jise woh apne paas dakhil karana chahtin mardon mein se; woh apni behan Umm Kulsoom aur apni behan ki betiyon ko hukm detin ke woh us ke liye use pilayen jise woh apne paas mardon aur aurton mein se dakhil karana chahtin. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki baqi biwiyon ne inkar kiya ke un ke paas is razat se logon mein se koi dakhil ho. Unhon ne farmaya: Hum nahin samajhte jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sahlah bint Suhail ko hukm diya magar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf se sirf Salim ke liye rukhsat thi; hamare paas is razat se koi dakhil nahin hoga. Is khabar par Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwiyan bade ke doodh ke bare mein thin. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Raza' se nikali."
"1191","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Siqah ne, mera khayal hai Ismail bin Ibrahim hain, hamein khabar di, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Salim se, apne walid se: Ghailan bin Salamah Saqafi Musalman hue jabke un ke paas das biwiyan thin. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Chaar rakho, aur baqi se alag ho jao."
"1192","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se Ghailan ki hadees."
"1193","[AI-translation] Hamare baaz ashab ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, Abdul Majeed bin Sahl bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, Auf bin Haris se, Naufal bin Muawiyah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Musalman hua jabke mere nikah mein paanch biwiyan thin. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ek se alag ho jao, aur chaar rakho. To main sab se purani ki taraf gaya jo mere paas sath saal se baanjh thi, aur us se alag ho gaya."
"1194","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Ishaq bin Abdullah se, Abu Wahb Jaishani se, Abu Khirash se, Dailami ya Ibn Dailami se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Musalman hua jabke mere nikah mein do behnen thin. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke main un dono mein se jise chahun rakhun aur doosri se alag ho jaun."
"1195","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Saqeef ke us aadmi se farmaya jo Musalman hua tha jabke us ke paas das biwiyan thin: Chaar rakho aur baqi se alag ho jao."
"1196","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se: Safwan bin Umayyah Islam se bhaage. Phir woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye aur Hunain aur Taif mein mushrik hokar shareek hue, jabke un ki biwi Musalman thi; dono nikah par qayam rahe. Ibn Shihab ne farmaya: Safwan aur un ki biwi ke Islam ke darmiyan taqreeban ek mah tha. Yeh chaar hadeesein Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, paanchwin Kitab Ta'reez bil Khitbah se, aur chhathi Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
